# Copy this file to ".env" (same folder) and restart OmniPost (npm start).

# Optional: the official "Sign in with Google" popup, pre-filled with the account already signed in
# to your browser. Free, no billing, no secret needed. How to get one:
#   1. https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials  ->  Create credentials  ->  OAuth client ID
#      (if asked, set up the consent screen first: External, app name "OmniPost", your email)
#   2. Application type: Web application
#   3. Authorized JavaScript origins: add BOTH  http://localhost  and  http://localhost:5170
#   4. Copy the "Client ID" (ends with .apps.googleusercontent.com) and paste it below.
GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=

# Optional overrides
# PORT=5170
# BROWSER_PATH=C:\Program Files\Google\Chrome\Application\chrome.exe
# OMNIPOST_DATA=D:\OmniPostData
